This simply adds a line to sysdata:log/calls (and SysOpLog if you're
using SN UserLogs) stating that the system was reset on time/date.

To disable the blanker when someone is logging on, insert the following
text in your bbstext on line #13 BEFORE anything else on the line.

{#0PFiles:ResetLog}

The above { is actually a control-Q commands and remember to modify the
path to where you placed the "ResetLog" script.
